services to operational resources, test the ability of remaining within these impact tolerances during 
severe but plausible disruption scenarios , and identify vulnerabilities where impact tolerances 
cannot be met at present . The operational resilience requirements outlined in these policy 
statements became effective on 31 March 2022. In  addition, the regulatory expectations are for 
identified vulnerabilities to be remediated to within their impact tolerances by 31 March 2025. 
