Consumer duty 
The FCA's new consumer duty came into force on 31 July 2023 with respect to firms ' new and existing 
products or services that are open to sale or renewal (as for closed products or services, the rules apply from 
31 July 2024, and prior to this deadline firms were required to review their closed products and make certain 
